Highlights (for review)




                                                 Highlights

       ¾ Genomic information of cellulosome-embedded prokaryotes in ADs were commented;

       ¾  Substrate-related factors of lignocellulosic biomass in ADs were introduced;

       ¾  Cellulosome related subunits were overviewed with corresponding genes;

       ¾  Cellulose separation methods to enhance cellulosome cellulolysis were studied;

       ¾  Benefits and mechanisms of micro-aeration and enzyme additions were reported.
